  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-9839bd8d2d36d69d853b1d46",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "1. 用等效增益 K 替代无记忆非线性环节。2. 绘制随该增益变化的根轨迹。3. 对于一定范围内的输入信号幅值，等效增益将取相应范围内的值。4. 将增益视作固定值，考察该范围内的闭环根。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "1. Replace the memoryless nonlinearity by an equivalent gain K. 2. Plot a root locus versus this gain. 3. For a range of input signal amplitudes, the equivalent gain will take on a range of values. 4. Examine the closed-loop roots in this range as if the gain were fixed.",
